#: EditPage.cpp:195
msgid ""
"The KDE Power Management System will now generate a set of defaults based on "
"your computer's capabilities. This will also erase all existing "
"modifications you made. Are you sure you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"El sistema de xestión d'enerxía KDE xenerará agora un conxuntu d'axustes por "
"defeutu basaos nes capacidaes del to ordenador. Esto tamién desaniciará les "
"modificaciones que fixeres. ¿De xuru que quies siguir?"

#: EditPage.cpp:198
msgid "Restore Default Profiles"
msgstr "Restaurar pefiles por defeutu"

#: EditPage.cpp:277
msgid ""
"The Power Management Service appears not to be running.\n"
"This can be solved by starting or scheduling it inside \"Startup and Shutdown"
"\""
msgstr ""
"Paez que nun ta executándose'l serviciu de xestión d'enerxía.\n"
"Esto pue iguase aniciando o programándolu dientro d'«Aniciu y apagáu»"

